<BaseLayout title='Approach | Trouvus' description='The Trouvus Strategy-to-Scale Framework: diagnose, prioritize, design, pilot and scale.'>
<section class="page-hero"><canvas class="hero-canvas" data-variant="waves"></canvas><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Approach</div><h1>The Trouvus Strategy-to-Scale Framework.</h1><p class="lead">A disciplined method for moving from strategic uncertainty to scalable organizational capability.</p></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><img src="/images/strategy-to-scale.svg" alt="Strategy-to-Scale Framework: Diagnose, Prioritize, Design, Pilot, Scale" width="640" height="300" style="border-radius:22px;margin-bottom:10px"><div class="steps"><div class="step"><img class="stage-icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/stage-diagnose.svg" alt=""><h2>1. Diagnose</h2><p class="small muted">Clarify priorities, readiness, constraints and the current operating system.</p></div><div class="step"><img class="stage-icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/stage-prioritize.svg" alt=""><h2>2. Prioritize</h2><p class="small muted">Rank opportunities by value, feasibility, strategic relevance, risk and readiness.</p></div><div class="step"><img class="stage-icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/stage-design.svg" alt=""><h2>3. Design</h2><p class="small muted">Redesign decisions, workflows, roles, controls and the human-machine interface.</p></div><div class="step"><img class="stage-icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/stage-pilot.svg" alt=""><h2>4. Pilot</h2><p class="small muted">Run bounded experiments with explicit hypotheses, metrics and ownership.</p></div><div class="step"><img class="stage-icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/stage-scale.svg" alt=""><h2>5. Scale</h2><p class="small muted">Institutionalize successful solutions through governance and capability-building.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="rule"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">Diagnostic first</div><h2>Every engagement begins with an honest readiness picture.</h2></div><div><img src="/images/readiness-diagnostic.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="AI Transformation Readiness Diagnostic across five dimensions" width="640" height="300" style="border-radius:22px"><p class="muted">The AI Transformation Readiness Diagnostic assesses strategic alignment, data, technology, governance and workforce capability—identifying the binding constraint before any tool is selected.</p></div></div></section><section class="rule"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">Engagement principles</div><h2>How we make transformation decisions.</h2></div><div class="grid-2"><div class="card"><img class="icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/icon-evidence.svg" alt=""><h3>Evidence before enthusiasm</h3><p class="muted">Emerging technology is evaluated against business logic, implementation conditions and verifiable outcomes.</p></div><div class="card"><img class="icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/icon-strategy.svg" alt=""><h3>Strategy before technology</h3><p class="muted">Technology choices should follow strategic priorities and operating requirements.</p></div><div class="card"><img class="icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/icon-workforce.svg" alt=""><h3>Capability before scale</h3><p class="muted">Scaling before ownership, competence and governance produces brittle transformation.</p></div><div class="card"><img class="icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/icon-bizmodel.svg" alt=""><h3>Human agency alongside automation</h3><p class="muted">Efficiency should not be purchased by eroding diagnostic judgment or adaptive capacity.</p></div></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><div class="cta"><div><div class="eyebrow">Executive AI Value Diagnostic</div><h2>Begin with the decision—not the tool.</h2><p class="muted">A focused 90-minute working session can clarify the opportunity, screen readiness and risk, and define the most credible next step.</p></div><a class="btn accent" href="/contact/?interest=diagnostic">Request the diagnostic</a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
